emFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">苹果发布 iOS 27 系统，Siri 升级为独立应用并支持持续对话</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">百度发布秒哒App移动端，实现99%代码自主生成并上线企业版</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI与微软修订收入分成协议，将支付总额上限锁定为380亿美元</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌发布AI笔记本平台Googlebook，Gemini模型重构指针交互与系统底层</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/48f9c60fbf4c405c8252fd1c73e5a1cc.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌正式发布AI笔记本平台Googlebook，将Gemini模型深度整合至系统底层，实现个人计算从应用驱动向模型驱动的范式转变。该平台核心技术革新在于将Gemini能力嵌入“鼠标指针”，通过感应光标移动与停留实时分析屏幕内容并预测用户意图，如指向邮件日期触发会议预约、指向文本即时摘要等，打破了传统人机交互的线性逻辑。此外，Googlebook引入“动态桌面”概念，支持通过自然语言生成定制化仪表盘，并能跨应用自动调取Gmail、日历及网页信息。这种被称为“氛围计算（Vibe Computing）”的模式，使AI成为组织系统资源、重塑UI界面及处理复杂任务流的核心大脑，标志着AI PC行业正从工具属性向智能主体进化。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">蚂蚁灵波开源LingBot-VLA后训练工具链，仅需150条数据即可适配新机器人</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4dabf9667e4b53edfd4551849456dda7.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">蚂蚁集团旗下灵波科技正式开源具身基座模型LingBot-VLA的真机后训练工具链，旨在解决具身智能领域模型部署适配难的行业痛点。该工具链覆盖数据处理、训练配置、离线评测及编译加速部署四大环节，支持多LeRobot数据合并及关节维度映射标准化。LingBot-VLA基于2万小时真实机器人数据预训练，覆盖9种主流双臂机器人构型，在真机与仿真评测中表现优于π0.5。得益于底层代码库优化，其训练效率达到StarVLA、OpenPI等框架的1.5至2.8倍，仅需150条示教数据即可完成高质量任务迁移。目前，该项目已在GitHub开源，模型权重同步上线Hugging Face与ModelScope，并已完成与乐聚、松灵、星海图等多厂商机型验证，显著降低了具身智能模型适配的数据与算力门槛。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">苹果发布 iOS 27 系统，Siri 升级为独立应用并支持持续对话</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9858a18a31cf7c0ffc62086097c018f0.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">苹果正式宣布 iOS 27 系统重大升级，Siri 将转型为独立应用程序，具备持续对话能力，全面对标 ChatGPT、Claude 及 Gemini 等主流 AI 模型。新版 Siri 支持图文输入、文档上传及图片处理，并与“灵动岛”深度整合，唤醒时显示动态胶囊动画，结果以卡片呈现，用户可上滑进入类似 iMessage 的连续对话界面。系统新增“Search or Ask”功能，支持在任意界面下拉唤起，提供深入的应用内及全网搜索。苹果同时开放第三方 AI 选项，允许用户将 ChatGPT 或 Gemini 设为默认模型。此次更新还优化了图乐园、相机、照片及钱包等配套应用，标志着 Siri 从被动指令助手向主动式 AI 助理的战略转型。目前该功能暂不支持中国大陆地区。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">百度发布秒哒App移动端，实现99%代码自主生成并上线企业版</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6a992a7ad6a664ddd7e7be60b2da4c3f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">百度在Create 2026开发者大会上正式发布无代码开发平台“秒哒”App移动端版本及企业版。该平台核心亮点在于极高的自动化水平，官方披露其App由一名开发者独立完成，且99%的代码由秒哒自动生成。秒哒企业版同步上线，旨在通过自然语言指令助力企业快速构建业务应用，推动AI从内容生成向实际生产力转化。在商业化方面，该平台已展现出显著的变现潜力，早期开发者通过秒哒开发的工具已获得最高1000万元收益。目前，秒哒App已在主流应用商店上架。此次发布标志着无代码开发模式进入新阶段，通过降低开发门槛，加速“人人都是开发者”愿景落地，并有望重塑传统企业的数字化开发流程，成为行业降本增效的关键工具。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI与微软修订收入分成协议，将支付总额上限锁定为380亿美元</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/2cb8beb2512d5a53b38af86ce5743167.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI与微软已达成关键协议修订，将OpenAI向微软支付的收入分成总额上限设定为380亿美元。根据原协议，OpenAI需将其营收的20%分成给微软，若达成长期营收目标，该笔支付总额最高可达1350亿美元。此次调整意味着，若OpenAI实现预期的高增长，到2030年将累计节省约970亿美元成本，显著缓解了首席财务官Sarah Friar面临的财务压力，并提升了OpenAI的长期资本自主权。在财务合作深化的同时，微软CEO纳德拉近期在“马斯克诉OpenAI”案中出庭作证，明确表示马斯克此前未对微软投资OpenAI的合规性表达过担忧。截至去年10月，微软所持OpenAI股份账面浮盈已达1220亿美元。此次分成上限的敲定，标志着双方合作进入新的利益平衡期，在确保微软投资回报的同时，也为OpenAI在生成式AI竞赛</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
